This file is retained only as a historical reference for the previous
monolithic package layout.

Active control templates for the split package build now live under:

  control.d/libvulkan1
  control.d/libvulkan-dev
  control.d/vulkan-headers
  control.d/vulkan-sdk

`build-deb.sh` renders those templates into package-specific `DEBIAN/control`
files at build time.
